WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.307
Two robustness checks: swapping the ad-hoc
initialisation for Erdős–Rényi and configuration-model

00:00:06.387 --> 00:00:08.743
generators barely changes any metric,

00:00:08.823 --> 00:00:12.760
and adding a proper held-out test set lowers scores
slightly.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:18.423
But a deeper diagnostic finds the tree generators
mostly produce unsimplifiable trees,

00:00:18.503 --> 00:00:23.954
only thirteen percent of Boolean and twenty-six
percent of Peano samples are usable,

00:00:24.034 --> 00:00:25.600
undercutting those tasks.
